- ¿Eso es todo?

437
00:26:47,405 --> 00:26:49,863
Qué gran final.

438
00:26:51,238 --> 00:26:52,238
Cierto.

439
00:26:53,071 --> 00:26:55,530
New Hope, ni chance.

440
00:26:56,196 --> 00:26:58,946
Esperen a la presentación magistral.

441
00:27:43,696 --> 00:27:44,696
Estoy bien, ma.

