470
00:30:08,863 --> 00:30:11,065
¡Vamos, Churners!

471
00:30:11,155 --> 00:30:12,363
Vamos, Churners.

472
00:30:13,863 --> 00:30:15,773
Cielos, me muero

473
00:30:15,863 --> 00:30:19,523
